      "en": ": The way I am isn’t what you want. If it was, we’d be able to make it through one special moment without pulling apart.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because you’re one of the only bright spots in my life.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then either you’re lying right to my face or you just love the dark.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not lying. And, believe it or not, I prefer the light.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene somewhere29",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/somewhere29.webp",
      "alt": "somewhere29"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then tell me what I can do to shine brighter.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tell me what steps I need to take so that one day, you walk away from someone else for me.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is such a thing possible? Is there even a future out there like that?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somewhere.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But the Noriko in that future is one who didn’t change just to get closer to me- it’s one who stuck to her guns and remained true to herself throughout all of the hardships.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But that’s the same thing as saying-",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I need you to suffer for me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene somewhere30",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/somewhere30.webp",
      "alt": "somewhere30"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I tried warning you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That all I can do is hold you back.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That you’ll be better off just living your life without me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’m selfish. And I know I’m holding some of the pieces you need to move on in my hands.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t let them go. And I don’t want to let them go because the idea of a future without you in it scares me...even though I know it would be a million times better for you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s why I need you to suffer.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I need you to sacrifice your happiness and stay addicted to me so I don’t have to feel things I don’t want to feel.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s a horrible...horrible thing to ask someone.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know. I-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’ll do it.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know I will. I’d do anything for you.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, like Ami said, everyone has limits. And what happened back there pushed past mine.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I need time to get my head back on straight...and re-evaluate some things now that I know what you two are really like.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do I disgust you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m much more disgusted by what you did to me than what you did with her.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m a strong girl, Akira- but I’ve never felt more powerless in my life.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should have said no.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I tried.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should have tried harder.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s a teenage girl just like me. She doesn’t control you. And I don’t know what sort of obligation you think you have to her, but you don’t.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami is like a sister to me. But I swear...if I hear her speak that way to you again?...I...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t really know what I’ll do. But she won’t like it.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry you have to go through this, Noriko....I’m sorry I’m putting you through this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Akira Arakawa I know wouldn’t apologize. He’d uncomfortably glance off to the side and then have some deep inner-monologue about what this means for the future.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t...think I know that right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Figure it out.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And skip the fingering the next time you invite me over.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because right now, I’m going to go back to the dorm and cry into Kirin’s lap...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But as soon as I see you again, I’m going to make you realize you’ve been fucking the wrong little girls this whole time.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Got it?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I love you.",
